  "body": "## Install\n\n- **Ubuntu 22.04+**: `sudo apt install ./ENDB_0.2.1_amd64.deb`, or run the AppImage.\n- **Windows 10/11**: run `ENDB_0.2.1_x64-setup.exe`.\n- **Portable (any PHP 8.1+ server)**: upload `endb.php` (checksum in `endb.php.sha256`) and open it in a browser.\n\n## What's new\n\n- **Updates from inside the app**: Settings → About → Updates checks for a new version, shows what is new, downloads it (checksum verified) and installs it (.deb, AppImage or Windows installer), then restarts. Updates come from the public EN releases list (github.com/mestiaque/en-releases).\n",
